              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਕਲਾਸ (kalaas) — kalās — school class; grade."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Hear and say the whole word before reading it. Keep it as one whole school noun rather than inventing smaller Punjabi pieces. This lesson owns the word alone; the complete identity frame comes only after a separate retrieval."
            }
